{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45","id":4906133110,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVApLyM8AAAABJG2mdg","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45","diff_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45","number":45,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: 修复中文金额解析、源文事件去重与评分","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 问题与行为\n\n模型金额被裁剪后可能丢失范围、外币、算式、部分付款或主体/期间语义；同额候选也可能跨事件误合并。此PR保留原始输出、原文与码点，将缺乏支持的金额和关联降为待核，不将协议接受当作业务确认。Issue #42 的冻结标签、模型原回答及事件评分对比另在依赖本PR的 #46。\n\n本轮继续处理真实审查：高达/高達/低至保守留空；翻一倍等有限倍数语法不计算结果；拒绝裁剪已附着的后置¥/￥；支持同主体明确发薪日期；仅在唯一同源位置与全部属性相同下合并前置工资词变体，两笔同额事件继续分别保留。\n\n## 实际验证\n\n- 当前提交 `66581e78f695cf4ed70e9b1bde2f1456814f8b05`：本地完整检查104.704秒退出0，Vitest1789/46文件、runtime9304通过/1平台跳过、材料67通过/1平台跳过；lint0错误23警告。\n- ROUND38锁定独立20项：固定d963旧提交两版Node各5P15F→实际整合两版各20P0F。作者及独立新用例合计227项通过。\n- 相同447项隔离HTTP：旧构建429P18F→当前447P0F；448份原注入回答保留，真实隔离Worker/D1/R2与TXT处理，cleanup通过。模型输出为合成注入，不是业务验收或模型推理。\n- 首轮完整检查的10个旧后置符号预期冲突完整保留。非实现者复核后只迁移对应分类，金额仍为null，853项相关回归通过；没有为通过检查恢复不可靠确数。\n- 两次旧CI失败均保留：端口重占导致旧归属断言不充分、新受控listener未处理ECONNRESET。仅修测试夹具；原进程组/原连接/旁组/清理断言保留，真实TCP reset和非预期错误传播均有回归。\n- 新提交CI：[39157925394](https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/actions/runs/39157925394)，当前正在运行，不能提前记为远端通过。\n\n## 边界\n\n高达也可能强调确数，保守留空会增加人工核对；有限语法不证明所有自然语言/OCR情形安全。原raw、拒收、旧冻结与失败记录均在#46追加保存。技术验证与人工业务验收分开；不训练、不部署生产。本PR尚未合并。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T19:16:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"30f712777593602a6d47b50a0898f1f57f56d05f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/66581e78f695cf4ed70e9b1bde2f1456814f8b05","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-guards","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-guards","sha":"66581e78f695cf4ed70e9b1bde2f1456814f8b05","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github